WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
The mitzvah myrtle has restrictions on fragrance

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.340
use.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.640
Keep a separate alternative nearby.

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:09.540
Removing an unnecessary temptation makes respectful practice

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.040
easier.
